+    By default, *keep_separator* is ``True`` and separators are included.
+    Set this keyword-only option to ``False`` to omit each item that triggers
+    a split. Leading and consecutive separators produce empty lists, but a
+    final separator does not produce an extra trailing list. Empty input
+    produces no lists:
